  "fit_rules": "Core track: UX / user / mixed-methods research roles from mid-level to principal.\nAdjacent tracks (designer, research-heavy product/program manager) only when the role leans on research, strategy or the candidate's domains.\nSkip (hard blockers): hybrid/onsite outside the listed onsite cities; remote roles whose required core hours don't fit the candidate's time zone; citizenship or security clearance required; PhD required; internships or entry level; Director/VP/Head-of roles; pure visual/brand/motion design; engineering or data-science roles; roles centered on a skill the profile lacks."
}